          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "Container escape chain detected (severity=high, score=0.71).\n\nChain: Shared /dev/shm cross-container data exfil \u2192 Ptrace host processes\n\nWritable /dev/shm shared between containers on the same host allows cross-container data exchange and exfiltration. Note: every container has a writable /dev/shm by default \u2014 this technique only represents an actual exposure when the IPC namespace is shared with the host (hostIPC) or with another pod via an explicit shared emptyDir volume.",
            "markdown": "### Shared /dev/shm cross-container data exfil\n\n**Severity:** high \u00b7 **Composite score:** 0.71\n\n**Chain steps:**\n1. `tmpfs_shm_cross_container` \u2014 Shared /dev/shm cross-container data exfil\n2. `cap_sys_ptrace` \u2014 Ptrace host processes\n\n**PoC:**\n```sh\n# Write to shared /dev/shm for cross-container exfil\necho 'exfil_data' > /dev/shm/shared_payload && ls -la /dev/shm/\n# Attach to host PID 1 and inject shellcode\nnsenter --target 1 --mount --uts --ipc --net --pid -- /bin/bash\n```"
